## Objective

To understand the interface of Adobe Photoshop and learn to use basic tools for creating designs with shapes, colours, and text.

## Tools Used

* Move Tool
* Marquee Tool
* Lasso Tool
* Brush Tool
* Eraser Tool
* Shape Tool
* Text Tool

## Steps

